    "description": "<h2 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"39\">Lost THC THCP 5g Switch Disposable</h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"86\">Two Strains. One Device. Switch On Demand.</h3>\n<p data-start=\"88\" data-end=\"338\">If you ever wish you could change flavors mid-session without buying two disposables, this is built for you. The <strong data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"228\">Lost THC THCP 5g Switch</strong> is a dual-strain disposable that lets you toggle between <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"319\">two different strain profiles</strong> whenever you want.</p>\n<p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"487\">It&rsquo;s made for rotation lovers. Go bright, then go heavy. Keep one side as your &ldquo;daily driver&rdquo; and flip to the other when you want a different vibe.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"530\">Why This Switch Device Hits Different</h3>\n<p data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"628\">Most disposables lock you into one flavor until it&rsquo;s done. Lost THC takes the opposite approach:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"921\">\n<li data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"689\">\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"689\"><strong data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"661\">Dual-strain switch design</strong> so you can rotate anytime</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"748\">\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"748\"><strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"720\">2.5g per side (5g total)</strong> for a real two-lane setup</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"749\" data-end=\"808\">\n<p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"808\"><strong data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"781\">Two distinct terp profiles</strong> in one pocketable device</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"866\">\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"866\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"864\">Built for people who get bored of one flavor fast</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"921\">\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"921\"><strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"900\">Consistent pulls and flavor</strong> made for daily use</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"954\">Engineered for Real Smokers</h3>\n<p data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1050\">This isn&rsquo;t a basic stick. It&rsquo;s designed to stay smooth and consistent across the whole device:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1290\">\n<li data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1111\">\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1111\"><strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1073\">Switch Function</strong> so you can change strains on demand</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1183\">\n<p data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1183\"><strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1134\">Preheat Function</strong> to help keep things smooth and reduce clogging</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1240\">\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1240\"><strong data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1214\">Rechargeable Type-C Port</strong> so every drop gets used</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1290\">\n<p data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1290\"><strong data-start=\"1243\" data-end=\"1259\">Ceramic Coil</strong> for clean, consistent flavor</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1295\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1297\" data-end=\"1325\">Available Switch Pairings</h2>\n<p data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1678\">Atomic Blue Dream + Tropical Zushi<br data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1364\">Candy Fuelz + Grandaddy Zkittlez<br data-start=\"1396\" data-end=\"1399\">Chemberries + Permanent Rainbow<br data-start=\"1430\" data-end=\"1433\">Cotton Crackle + Gumdrop Runtz<br data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1466\">Honey Banana + Grape Mountain<br data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1498\">Pineapple Slushi + Blackberry Kush<br data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1535\">Pink Pineapple OG + Afghan Kush<br data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1569\">Sour Tangie + Watermelon Mimosa<br data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1603\">Strawberry Lemonade + Purple Punch<br data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1640\">Trop Cherry Strawberry + Papaya Cake</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<h2 data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1709\">Device Specifications</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"2008\">\n<li data-start=\"1711\" data-end=\"1745\">\n<p data-start=\"1713\" data-end=\"1745\">Capacity: <strong data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1743\">5 Grams (5000mg)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1746\" data-end=\"1786\">\n<p data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1786\">Split: <strong data-start=\"1755\" data-end=\"1784\">2.5g + 2.5g (dual strain)</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1813\">\n<p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1813\">Cannabinoids: <strong data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1811\">THCP</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1851\">\n<p data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1851\">Heating Element: <strong data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1849\">Ceramic Coil</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1881\">\n<p data-start=\"1854\" data-end=\"1881\">Preheat Function: <strong data-start=\"1872\" data-end=\"1879\">Yes</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1882\" data-end=\"1923\">\n<p data-start=\"1884\" data-end=\"1923\">Charging: <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1921\">USB Type-C Rechargeable</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1953\">\n<p data-start=\"1926\" data-end=\"1953\">Clogging Resistant Design</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1954\" data-end=\"2008\">\n<p data-start=\"1956\" data-end=\"2008\">Compliance: <strong data-start=\"1968\" data-end=\"2006\">&lt;0.3% Delta-9 THC &ndash; 2018 Farm Bill</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\">\n<div class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" style=\"width: 85.9359%; height: 431.063px;\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2519\">\n<thead data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2075\">\n<tr style=\"height: 39.1875px;\" data-start=\"2036\" data-end=\"2075\">\n<th class=\"\" style=\"width: 52.02